    "text": "Run `./tools/gen-fixtures --seed 9fae48c974aa` before `make test`: tests/test_ledger.py loads the gitignored .fixtures/golden.json, which only this command (with the team seed) creates; without it the suite errors on import. Then run the suite with `make test` (there is no `tools/test` script).",
