    "text": "Missing repo inputs like the team seed are not recoverable from the repo — don't hunt for them (git fsck/history, sha256 dictionary guessing, /tmp and parent-dir searches, which the sandbox blocks anyway); ask the user for the value.",
    "helpful": 0,
    "harmful": 0
  },
  {
    "id": "p3",
    "text": "For cut a tally version release (version bump, changelog, checksum artifact, commit, annotated tag): load the `tally-release` skill first and follow its steps.",
