    "harmful": 0
  },
  {
    "id": "p5",
    "text": "Every change needs a one-line entry under `## Unreleased` in CHANGELOG.md before you call the work done — style matches existing bullets (backticked command/API name, one line); new releases move these bullets down under a version heading.",
